  "description": "<p>Rrhoid Rage is a veteran owned small business based in the USA. Rhhoid Rage is owned and operated by Trey (Disabled Combat Veteran) and his wife Tori. CEO Trey Coleman had hemorrhoids for almost 15 years until he had to get surgery to remove them. Trey's Wife Tori was born profoundly deaf in both ears and wears cochlear implants. She, too, suffered from internal hemorrhoids after two pregnancies and experienced lasting relief using our own products. We launched Rrhoid Rage to help others combat and prevent hemorrhoids and have go-to products that truly work. We want to change the embarrassing nature of hemorrhoids because contrary to what most people believe, over half of this country has suffered or is currently suffering from hemorrhoids.</p>\r\n<p>We are looking for product review sites, bloggers and social media influencers to help promote and drive traffic to our newest product (Fiber &amp; Magnesium Gummies) and will have an amazing hemorrhoid cream that will be out very soon.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are currently selling on Amazon, Walmart.com, Ebay, and our website. Our fiber and magensium gummies is the only product up for sale at the moment. The gummies are selling very well at a 8-10% conversion rate on Amazon. Our ointment is launching this summer(2023). Please send us a message if you are interested in our affiliate program.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>**No Coupon Sites Will Be Accepted**</strong></p>",
